>>
Rule 1 (image must be 3D or 4D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∨ ndim(v_1) = 4
>>
Rule 2 (3D image must have positive height, width, and channels)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (4D image must have positive height, width, and channels)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 4 then shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (seed must be a 1-D vector of length 2)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = 2
>>
Rule 5 (seed dtype must be int32 or int64)
{v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 4
>>
Rule 7 (image must be at least three-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 8 (inner 3 dims of image must be > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then ∀i ∈ [0, 2] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 else if ndim(v_1) = 4 then shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0
>>
Rule 10 (inner three dimensions of image must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then ∀i ∈ [0, 2] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 else if ndim(v_1) = 4 then ∀i ∈ [1, 3] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 else false
>>
Rule 13 (image rank must be between 3 and 4)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 3 ≤ ndim(v_1) ∧ ndim(v_1) ≤ 4
>>
Rule 15 (seed must be a 1-D tensor with exactly two elements)
{v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_2) = 1 then shape(v_2, 0) = 2 else false
>>
Rule 16 (seed dtype must be 32-bit or 64-bit integer)
{v_2 : tensor} |= 3 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 4
